<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Judi Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">JUD</para>
  <para style="toc1">Judi</para>
  <para style="toc2">JUD</para>
  <para style="mt1">Judi a Bataki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Judi Alla la Kuma Mɛn Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Judi Kitabu yɔrɔ mɛn sɛbɛni, wo kawandili madonni Piyɛri la sɛbɛli filana le ri, a gbengben a suran filana. Ii fila bɛɛ mɔɔilu le masɔsɔla mɛnilu dina fuuilu lasela mɛnilu tɛ kɛni hankili ɲuma ri.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuwaliilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Nde Judi le ka ɲin sɛbɛ, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baaraden, Yakuba nakelenɲɔɔ. N ka a lawa an Fa Alla la mɔɔ kiliniilu ma, a ka mɛnilu kanin, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye mɛnilu kandanna.<verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Alla ye kininkinin ni jususuma ni kaninteya sabati ai rɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wuya karanmɔɔilu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>N kanintenilu, a lɔɔ tɛrɛ ye n na kosɛbɛ n ye ɲin sɛbɛ ai ma ka bɛn an kisi ko ma, kɔni n ka a yen de fo n ye a sɛbɛ le ka bɛn ai fanka don ko ma lemɛniya makaran dɔ Alla ra mɛn karifa a la jama sɛniman ma siɲa kelen haan habadan. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Ka a masɔrɔn mɔɔ doilu ra don ai tɛma gbundu rɔ mɛnilu jalaki ko tɛrɛ ra sɛbɛ kɛbi a waati jan. Alla lɔnbaliilu le woilu ri, mɛnilu ye Alla la sɔlini kɛla ko haramuninilu kɛ kun di, ka ii ban Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na, an tii kelen pe, an Maari.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Kɔni hali ai ka ko ɲin lɔn, n ye a labila ko rɔ ai la ko Maari ka Isirayɛli jama lakisi le Misiran jamana rɔ, kɔni a ka lemɛniyabaliilu fanan halaki wo kɔ rɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Mɛlɛka doilu fanan ma ii jɛrɛ to ii wara, ka ii ban ii lɔdiya la, Alla ka woilu bila dibi ba rɔ, ii sidini habadan jɔlɔkɔilu la haan kiti la lon ba. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>A ye wo ɲa le ma, Sɔdɔmu ni Kɔmɔri ni ii laminin soilu fanan tɛrɛ jalonya kɛla ka laɲɔɔya kɛ ii ɲɔɔn na ɲa do ma mɛn bɛnni tɛ adamadenilu tɛma. Alla ka woilu fanan kɛ le misali ri, ka ii ɲakankatan habadan ta rɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.7</char> A ragbɛ A Damira suran 19 kuma diya 1 haan 29 kɔndɔ.</note><verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Wo mɔɔ mɛnilu donni ai tɛma, woilu fanan ye siboilu kɛla mɛnilu ye a kɛla ii ye ko haramuninilu kɛ ii fariilu la, ka murunti sariyatiilu ma, ka mɛlɛkailu lafɛya. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Baa, hali mɛlɛka kuntii Mikayɛli ma susu Ibulusa jalaki nanili kɛla. Ii tɛrɛ ye ko masɔsɔla waati mɛn na ka bɛn Musa su la ko ma, a ka a fɔ ko, «Maari Alla ye kuma i kanma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.9</char> Tariku mɛn na ko fɔ yan, wo tɛ yenna Kitabu kɔndɔ yɔrɔ gbɛrɛ. </note> <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Kɔni mɔɔ ɲinilu ye mɔɔ mafɔla ko rɔ ii ti mɛn ɲayenna. Ii ka wo doilu lɔn ii la hankilidɔɔya rɔ ikomin soboilu hankili tɛ mɛnilu la, adon wo le yati ye ii bilala halaki rɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Gbalo ye ii yɛ baa ii ra bila Kabila misali kɔfɛ. Ii ra ii bori tɔnɔilu kɔfɛ fili rɔ ikomin Balami. Ii ra halaki ka a masɔrɔn ii ra murunti ikomin Kora.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.11</char> <char style="fk">Kabila</char> a la ko ragbɛ A Damira suran 4 kuma diya 3 haan 8 kɔndɔ. <char style="fk">Balami</char> a la ko ragbɛ Jateilu Suran 31 kuma diya 16 kɔndɔ. <char style="fk">Kora</char> a la ko ragbɛ Jateilu suran 16 kuma diya 1 haan 35 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="JUD 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Wo mɔɔilu ra ai la nakelenɲɔɔya ladɛnnilu laharamun, ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ai fɛ haan! Ii tɛ maloyala, ka karan ii jɛrɛ dɔrɔn na. Ii kɛni de ikomin banda wa fin ka fo, fɔɲɔ ye donna mɛn kɔrɔ ka lafɔ. Ii kɛni le fanan ikomin fira kɔrɔ wulen waati jiri mɛnilu ti sɔn nadenna, ii ra bɔ, ka faa siɲa fila. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Ii kɛni le ikomin ji wunwannailu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.13</char> <char style="fk">Ji wunwannailu:</char> ikomin fɔɲɔ wo don ji rɔ.</note> ii ye malobaliya koilu lajɛnsɛnna ikomin kɔɔji kanfa, ikomin lolo tununnin mɛnilu ye wala sunna habadan mɛn lamarani dun dibi ba rɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>N benba Adama bɔnsɔn wɔrɔnwulana Hanɔki ka nabiya kumailu fɔ iile le la ko rɔ ko, «Ii ɲa lɔ! Maari ye nala a ni a la mɛlɛka sɛniman waa siyaman, <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>kosa a ye na bɛɛ makiti, ka Alla lɔnbaliilu bɛɛ sɔn yiraka ii la ii la Alla lɔnbaliya baarailu la ko rɔ, a ni Alla lɔnbaliya kojuukɛlailu la kuma gbɛlɛn mɛnilu bɛɛ lɔni Alla ma.» <verse eid="JUD 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Wo mɔɔilu ye tola ii dalakasila, ii tɛ wasala. Ii bilani ii la kunfan koilu le dɔrɔn kɔfɛ, ka to jɛrɛdabaya kumailu fɔla, ka mɔɔilu matɔɔ fen ko rɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kawandili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Kɔni n kanintenilu, an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenbailu ra ko natɔ mɛnilu ko fɔ, wo ye labila ai la. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Ii ka a fɔ le ai yɛ ko, «Mɔɔ mayɛlɛla ri na le waati laban dɔ, mɛnilu bilani ii la Alla lɔnbaliya kunfan koilu kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Wo kojuu kɛlailu le ai ratalanna, ii ye bilala ii la dunuɲa hankili kɔfɛ, Nii Sɛniman tɛ mɛnilu fɛ. <verse eid="JUD 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Kɔni aile, n kanintenilu, ai ye to sabatila ai la lemɛniya sɛniman dɔ, ka Alla matara Nii Sɛniman dɔ. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Ai ye to Alla la kaninteya rɔ, ai wa kɛ Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina makɔnɔla waati mɛn na, ka wa ai ri ɲenemaya banbali rɔ.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Sika ye mɛnilu rɔ, ai ye hina woilu ma. <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>Ai ye ii faron ta rɔ, ka ii lakisi. Ai ye kininkinin doilu fanan ma Alla la ɲakɔrɔsilan dɔ, hali ii la faanin mɛnilu kɔsɔni ii faribanku diyana koilu fɛ, ii ri wo lagboyaɲɛ.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alla matara ni Alla tando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Mɛn di se ai latankala ko ai kana be, ka ai fɛɛtanilu jiraka a la gbiliya rɔ a ɲakɔrɔ sɛwa rɔ, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>gbiliya ni mansaya ni fanka ni se ye kɛ wo Alla kelen pe yɛ, an nakisila, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin baraka rɔ an Maari, kɛbi a damira haan bi haan habadan. Amina.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
